Release C SDK 0.6.0 with the ChordAction cause

Import sophia-wm-files-v1.kdl, sophia-wm-files.md and sophia-wm-api.md
unmodified from signed Sophia contract b0a2b0303b02af27598def07f455e8e0240b9366.
Capability bit 21, chord_actions, requires action_lifecycle, actions and
configuration. With it, a followed chord's keyboard activations arrive as
ChordAction (cause 8: activation serial, chord serial and action, all
nonzero). A client that selected the lifecycle alone keeps its 0.5.1 behaviour
and refuses cause 8; negotiation refuses chord_actions without its
dependencies.

ChordAction is qualified only by literal and scripted-peer tests: Session does
not send it yet.
